From: Gili <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:23:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] test: publish complete descendant PIDs before ConPTY
 readiness

TTY lifecycle fixtures use file existence as readiness. A direct Set-Content
can expose the destination before its PID bytes are complete. Reuse the
existing pending-file publication helper so the ready path appears only
after Set-Content completes. Keep both lifecycle assertions, strict PID
parsing, child behavior, permissions and deadlines unchanged.

Native RED: run40122105309, x64 job120965015488, Preserve phase reads
an empty descendant PID at tests.rs1040 after Terminate succeeds. The
readiness-contract gap is confirmed; the precise historical write/read
ordering remains an inference until native verification. This test-only
candidate does not establish native GREEN or repair ARM's separately
missing harness summary.

Prerequisite: full queue snapshot9ef2da302ceaaa71f5056a8f564313e7759f48ec
plus the exact seven workload fixture path changes from candidate
f0666aeac4541be3b6305d7a0e48263d123ccef4f786ac20062914d9ee28b1c6.
---
 codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/src/unified_exec/tests.rs | 5 +----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/src/unified_exec/tests.rs b/codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/src/unified_exec/tests.rs
index 53074215..900eaff9 100644
--- a/codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/src/unified_exec/tests.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/src/unified_exec/tests.rs
@@ -983,10 +983,7 @@ async fn assert_legacy_tty_descendant_lifecycle(
             powershell_literal(&survival_marker),
         ),
     };
-    let child_command = format!(
-        "Set-Content -LiteralPath '{}' -Value $PID; {child_tail}",
-        powershell_literal(&ready_marker),
-    );
+    let child_command = format!("{}; {child_tail}", publish_pid_command(&ready_marker));
     let parent_tail = match lifecycle {
         LegacyTtyDescendantLifecycle::Terminate => "Start-Sleep -Seconds 30".to_string(),
         LegacyTtyDescendantLifecycle::Preserve => format!(
-- 
